Package: dgen
Type: Package
Title: Classroom Datasets with Exact Summary Statistics
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Todd", "Daniel", email = "ToddDaniel@missouristate.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates datasets whose summary statistics match the targets
    you choose. Means, standard deviations, correlations and counts hold
    exactly in the rounded data students receive. Functions are named for
    the test being taught: one-sample, independent-samples and paired t
    tests, one-way ANOVA, correlation, multiple regression, one- and
    two-sample proportion tests, and chi-square tests. Each can also run the
    matching test, so instructors can check the result before assigning the
    data. Inspired by MorseGen (Morse, 2012)
    <https://vc.bridgew.edu/fac_articles/1>.
